      },
      "text": "```\n   greedy(items):\n      sort items by some KEY                # the greedy criterion — choosing this is the design\n      solution = empty\n      for item in sorted order:\n         if item is FEASIBLE with solution:  # respects the constraint\n            add item to solution             # COMMIT — never undo\n      return solution\n```"
    },
